    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present no. 66 Downpatrick Road Crumlin.\r\nDownpatrick Road is one of Crumlin’s well-established residential addresses, forming part of a vibrant and mature community on Dublin’s south side.  Developed during Dublin’s suburban growth in the mid-20th century the area is known for its tree-lined streets, strong sense of community, and excellent local amenities  making Downpatrick Road a highly desirable location for families and  alike.\r\nNamed after the historic town of Downpatrick, the road reflects a tradition of Irish place-name heritage that adds character to the neighbourhood.\r\nThis lovely mid-terrace family home offers purchasers the opportunity to own a property in an area where residents enjoy convenient access to schools, parks, shopping facilities, and transport links.\r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed by a generous entranceway which leads to you a large sunny living room with a feature fireplace.  Beyond the living area you will find a large family bathroom and modern kitchen extension with direct access to a patio and large sunny garden.\r\nOn the first floor you will find two generously sized bedrooms both of which feature large built in wardrobes.\r\nCombining bright, modernised accommodation with a superb location no.66 Downpatrick Road provides a rare opportunity to purchase a home in excellent decorative condition.   Early viewing is highly recommended to experience everything this property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nLarge living areas\r\nModern Kitchen\r\nGenerous Bedrooms\r\nLarge South-East Facing Garden\r\nPrime Location"
      },
